{
  "spoken_lines": [
    {
      "key": "gq001_03_iris_intro_01",
      "string_id": "5808175652976651507",
      "speaker": "Iris",
      "addressee": "V",
      "text": "You have the cache. Good. Keep it isolated—I don't know what it tries to shake hands with yet.",
      "audio_path": "mod\\gq001\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq001_03_iris_intro_01.wem",
      "duration_ms": 7040
    },
    {
      "key": "gq001_03_v_choice_iris_line",
      "string_id": "11426458429266979392",
      "speaker": "V",
      "addressee": "Iris",
      "text": "You're Iris? Patch made you sound less cautious.",
      "audio_path": "mod\\gq001\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq001_03_v_choice_iris_line.wem",
      "duration_ms": 4240
    },
    {
      "key": "gq001_03_iris_rsp_iris_01",
      "string_id": "15444959020279699416",
      "speaker": "Iris",
      "addressee": "V",
      "text": "Patch sells confidence. I clean up what confidence leaves behind.",
      "audio_path": "mod\\gq001\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq001_03_iris_rsp_iris_01.wem",
      "duration_ms": 4480
    },
    {
      "key": "gq001_03_v_choice_cache_line",
      "string_id": "12900856142081137023",
      "speaker": "V",
      "addressee": "Iris",
      "text": "He called it a datacache. What's actually inside?",
      "audio_path": "mod\\gq001\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq001_03_v_choice_cache_line.wem",
      "duration_ms": 3680
    },
    {
      "key": "gq001_03_iris_rsp_cache_01",
      "string_id": "13544956777757004105",
      "speaker": "Iris",
      "addressee": "V",
      "text": "Courier routes, identity fragments, memory edits. Enough pieces of real people to make the word data feel dishonest.",
      "audio_path": "mod\\gq001\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq001_03_iris_rsp_cache_01.wem",
      "duration_ms": 8000
    },
    {
      "key": "gq001_03_v_choice_next_line",
      "string_id": "139044715483194138",
      "speaker": "V",
      "addressee": "Iris",
      "text": "Tell me what happens next.",
      "audio_path": "mod\\gq001\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq001_03_v_choice_next_line.wem",
      "duration_ms": 1680
    },
    {
      "key": "gq001_03_iris_rsp_next_01",
      "string_id": "11667937095073985474",
      "speaker": "Iris",
      "addressee": "V",
      "text": "I pulled the index and left the payload sealed. Ghostline needs the physical cache somewhere our courier can reach.",
      "audio_path": "mod\\gq001\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq001_03_iris_rsp_next_01.wem",
      "duration_ms": 7840
    },
    {
      "key": "gq001_03_iris_rsp_next_02",
      "string_id": "11667935995562357263",
      "speaker": "Iris",
      "addressee": "V",
      "text": "I'll mark a drop point. Deposit it, walk away, and don't wait to see who collects.",
      "audio_path": "mod\\gq001\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq001_03_iris_rsp_next_02.wem",
      "duration_ms": 5440
    },
    {
      "key": "gq001_03_v_choice_keep_line",
      "string_id": "6352854931447748354",
      "speaker": "V",
      "addressee": "Iris",
      "text": "Why not keep it here and finish the job yourself?",
      "audio_path": "mod\\gq001\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq001_03_v_choice_keep_line.wem",
      "duration_ms": 3200
    },
    {
      "key": "gq001_03_iris_rsp_keep_01",
      "string_id": "18074904889826275154",
      "speaker": "Iris",
      "addressee": "V",
      "text": "Because this room is for reading ghosts, not inviting their owners to the door.",
      "audio_path": "mod\\gq001\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq001_03_iris_rsp_keep_01.wem",
      "duration_ms": 4560
    },
    {
      "key": "gq001_03_v_choice_leave_line",
      "string_id": "12760190581290167776",
      "speaker": "V",
      "addressee": "Iris",
      "text": "Fine. Send the drop point.",
      "audio_path": "mod\\gq001\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq001_03_v_choice_leave_line.wem",
      "duration_ms": 3120
    },
    {
      "key": "gq001_03_iris_rsp_leave_01",
      "string_id": "5439485647904912410",
      "speaker": "Iris",
      "addressee": "V",
      "text": "Already sent. And V—whatever you read in there, leave it in there.",
      "audio_path": "mod\\gq001\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq001_03_iris_rsp_leave_01.wem",
      "duration_ms": 5920
    }
  ],
  "choice_lines": [
    {
      "key": "gq001_03_v_choice_iris_short",
      "string_id": "5019230425433447540",
      "text": "You're Iris?"
    },
    {
      "key": "gq001_03_v_choice_cache_short",
      "string_id": "15949288964663299213",
      "text": "What's in the cache?"
    },
    {
      "key": "gq001_03_v_choice_next_short",
      "string_id": "9233365092272065458",
      "text": "What happens next?"
    },
    {
      "key": "gq001_03_v_choice_keep_short",
      "string_id": "9378840655841838010",
      "text": "Why not keep it?"
    },
    {
      "key": "gq001_03_v_choice_leave_short",
      "string_id": "10995410092991971732",
      "text": "Send the drop point."
    }
  ],
